      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Having decided to \"go solar\" during the period of Xmas and New Year was a bit dumb. No surprise that we only received one response re quotes etc.That firm was Switched On Electrical. We decided to get a couple of quotes from them and then went with the best system we could afford. The service was first-class.We received the quotes on the 29th of December and the system was installed yesterday. (18th of January ) That too was done very professional and orderly.One of the best things about all this... there were no hidden extras. Living in rural OZ we are quite used to having to pay the \" extras \" when the final bill arrives.What was quoted was what we paid!Quite  an unusual experience  these days.",
