      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The cost of my solar system included $1760 for moving my meter board from inside the house to a position adjacent to the inverter. This proved to be quite a job as the house was built in 1953 or thereabouts and the brickwork proved to be very solid. Unfortunately although this work and the installation of the solar panels was finalised on 7th Dec. I am still waiting for SA Power Networks to contact Rob Thursby of Switched On Electrical so that they together can get my system up and running. I do understand, however,that due to very adverse weather conditions SA Power Networks have been stretched to the limit in their efforts to restore power to people whose needs have been far greater than mine. Thus at this stage I can make very little meaningful comment beyond that which I have already made.",
